## ⚡ Overview
**WEBRTC CAN Realtime Transmission** enables high-speed, sub-millisecond latency telemetry streaming from **Controller Area Network (CAN)** bus systems directly to web browsers using **WebRTC DataChannels & MediaStreams**.

<p align="center">
  <img src="https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/74038190/212284100-561aa473-3905-4a80-b561-0d28506553ee.gif" width="700" alt="Animated Data Stream" />
</p>

## ✨ Key Features
- 🚀 **Real-time Streaming:** Low latency CAN frame transmission via WebRTC Peer Connections.
- 📡 **Bi-directional Control:** Send and receive CAN signals instantly.
- 📊 **Live Telemetry Visualization:** Animated charts and HUDs for vehicle/robotics data.
- 🔒 **Secure Peer-to-Peer:** Encrypted DTLS/SRTP communication direct to the dashboard.

## 🛠️ Architecture

```
[ CAN Bus ] ---> [ Edge Gateway ] ---> [ WebRTC DataChannel ] ---> [ Web Dashboard ]
```

